      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "A return journey is the most common wording.\n\nIf A to B is d km and B to A is also d km, the distances are equal automatically.\nSo the shortcut applies even if the question gives the route length as extra information.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
